props ([ba4ca78](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/ba4ca78c3868a4757cb92d912a54c8a237871b54))\n* **pack:** remove Npgsql package version 10.0.3 from Directory.Packages.props ([4e4ea5c](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/4e4ea5cdb4513ff520d3496c5ae277ffe3b64a04))\n* **pack:** replace inherited root readme with the module readme ([688eec9](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/688eec9a4333245cc0ff7772115c769094471863))\n* **pack:** restore Npgsql version for EventStore server ([90f3836](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/90f3836dd7482db35c2c187a50999b99215919b0))\n* **pack:** update HexalithEventStoreVersion to 3.112.0 ([8678281](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/86782814b2ab3d0e4c04be3a1c2946fa4cce390e))\n* **release:** pass publication flag through composite input ([3639c8d](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/3639c8d9340fc81d6f8e0a90566a97e56d5d8446))\n* update eventstore ([145ae92](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/145ae921d9032f110b7371614939559e0aee202a))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **ci:** add shared preparation for trusted NuGet releases ([eb17c93](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/eb17c93ac377520a1807a34b2f701ca67c36d2e2))\n* enhance package validation and version management in scripts ([360a2b9](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/360a2b9c4e96809365a7de785be9a68152d5ac28))\n* **g6:** add current runtime qualification evidence contract ([51af786](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/51af786cf156d2a3396dbd49f5e4898222e55c12))\n* **g6:** add G-6 current policy and auditing tool ([09c24c1](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/09c24c1432c0a06f9e9c49d5ba0f25f9d3d96e0e))\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/releases/400248435","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/releases/400248435/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Hexalit